{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Overgrown Cleaner</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164790/extras/89288103ab47c793cb33b644bd14c96b.poster.avif?t=1773326083\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164790/extras/89288103ab47c793cb33b644bd14c96b.webm?t=1773326083\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164790/extras/89288103ab47c793cb33b644bd14c96b.mp4?t=1773326083\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What a mess\u2026! It looks like no one has taken care of these places for years. Nature has taken over \u2014 waist-high weeds, buried pathways, and forgotten corners hidden beneath layers of wild growth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good thing you\u2019re here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Overgrown Cleaner, you\u2019ll turn chaos into order in one of the most satisfying clearing simulators out there. Relax as you cut, trim, mow, and carve your way through dense overgrowth \u2014 no back pain, no rush, just pure restoration.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Cut, Clear, Burn!</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164790/extras/8a99154323b742c5537b1ffdfdcc5463.poster.avif?t=1773326083\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164790/extras/8a99154323b742c5537b1ffdfdcc5463.webm?t=1773326083\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164790/extras/8a99154323b742c5537b1ffdfdcc5463.mp4?t=1773326083\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every location is a new challenge \u2014 and you have full freedom in how you tackle it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s up to you how you restore each area:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Slice through overgrown bushes<br>\u2022 Remove dead plants<br>\u2022 Reveal buried walls and fences<br>\u2022 Unearth buried paths&lt;<br>\u2022 Turn impassable thickets into pristine greenery</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go slow and methodical \u2014 or unleash total tool-powered destruction.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Explore Abandoned Locations</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164790/extras/2ebc9f2bcfed8714d9d8b0613c25990f.poster.avif?t=1773326083\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164790/extras/2ebc9f2bcfed8714d9d8b0613c25990f.webm?t=1773326083\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164790/extras/2ebc9f2bcfed8714d9d8b0613c25990f.mp4?t=1773326083\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forgotten gardens are only the beginning of your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your skills grow and your toolset expands, you\u2019ll unlock access to a variety of long-abandoned spaces, each reclaimed by wild nature:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 An abandoned skatepark swallowed by vines and cracked concrete<br>\u2022 A deserted farm left to rot beneath invasive growth<br>\u2022 A forgotten oriental garden where elegance hides under years of neglect<br>\u2022 An old, overgrown village with paths and structures lost to time</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each location brings new layouts, secrets, and restoration challenges.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Craft &amp; Upgrade Powerful Tools</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164790/extras/315c248cf47caf38545f45d9a8028277.poster.avif?t=1773326083\" width=800 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164790/extras/315c248cf47caf38545f45d9a8028277.webm?t=1773326083\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164790/extras/315c248cf47caf38545f45d9a8028277.mp4?t=1773326083\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can\u2019t afford store-bought equipment? Perfect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge parts, scrap, and strange finds to build your own gardening machinery:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Design unique tool builds<br>\u2022 Upgrade power and efficiency<br>\u2022 Customize gear to match your playstyle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your handcrafted creations will soon outperform commercial equipment.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Collect Valuable Items</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164790/extras/9600a1d67e96dfe5ba6dc58e6a447bbc.poster.avif?t=1773326083\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164790/extras/9600a1d67e96dfe5ba6dc58e6a447bbc.webm?t=1773326083\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164790/extras/9600a1d67e96dfe5ba6dc58e6a447bbc.mp4?t=1773326083\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dense greenery hides more than just weeds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While clearing areas, keep an eye out for:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Salvageable scrap<br>\u2022 Repairable parts<br>\u2022 Strange but useful leftovers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell your discoveries to fund workshop upgrades, better tools, and future jobs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fire up your mower, sharpen your blades, and reclaim what nature swallowed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The world is overgrown. Time to clean it.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3164790?t=1773326083","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164790/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773326083","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164790/650055b5d245b6786dfcf0195c11627f52efd065/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1773326083","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164790/650055b5d245b6786dfcf0195c11627f52efd065/capsule_184x69_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1773326083","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4094290,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Overgrown Cleaner</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://